  Slug: uzunjati
  DisplayName: Uzunjati
  IconPath: icons/magic/nature/tree-bare-glow-yellow.webp
  Description: 'Uzunjati are perhaps the most iconic Magaambyans, and certainly the
    best known beyond the Mwangi Expanse, because they are the storytellers who roam
    across Golarion gathering knowledge embedded in oral traditions and folklore.
    While they often travel as widely as Rain-Scribes, their focus is substantially
    different, for their exploration is always in service to collecting and preserving
    the spoken knowledge of community and culture. In addition to the magic of their
    own stories, they emphasize magic that protects and that affects others'' minds.
    Additional Curriculum cantrips: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Daze] 1st:
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mindlink], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Ventriloquism]
    2nd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Kgalaserke''s Axes] 3rd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Ibex''s
    Harvest] 4th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Telepathy] 5th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mind
    Probe], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Truespeech] 6th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mislead]
    7th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Retrocognition] 8th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Hidden
    Mind] 9th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Phantasmagoria]'
